## Frontier Movement

- Previous focused retry before rebuilding the patched binary: `compiler_rt.udivmodei4.__udivei5` stopped at `no_spill_envelope` / `stage2-register-pressure`.
- After rebuilding with the 32-slot spill envelope, the same row advanced to `no_emitter` / `stage2-phi-type`.
- After pointer phis were bound through selector scalar metadata as 64-bit GPR phi values, the same row advanced to `no_emitter` / `composed-block-call-form`.
- After well-formed `llvm.assume` was ignored and the exact `tail fastcc i16 @zig.target.intByteSize(i16 ...)` helper call lowered through the composed selector, the same row advanced to `no_spill_envelope` / `composed-block-spill-slots`.
- After frame indexes became data slots and planned spill reservations could grow past the fixed compatibility constants, the same row advanced to `no_emitter` / `composed-block-spill-loc`.
